Add direct includes that upstream core files received only transitively
through AsyncTask.h -> <QtConcurrent>, which the wasm AsyncTask
replacement does not include, and stub EntryAttachments::openAttachment:
QDesktopServices lives in QtGui, which is not part of the QtCore-only
wasm build, and a browser tab cannot hand a temp file to the desktop
anyway (attachment extraction happens on the JS side).

